Subject: [PATCH] backend/vulkan: recover swapchain acquisition during resize

Backport Filament Vulkan resize recovery for v1.54.0. Defer acquisition until
the first swapchain render pass, skip unavailable resize frames safely, and
drain queued work before releasing old swapchain images and synchronization.
This prevents resize failures from contaminating Gaussian Splat offscreen work.

